{"id":"n15937-1-6","stage":3,"title":"겁나다 · 畏惧","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15937-1-6-1","ko":"우리 선생님께 사실대로 말씀드리자.","zh":"我们还是把实情告诉老师吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님께","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님께","audio":"/audio/bcdd3ceebd3e89795264.mp3"}},{"text":"사실대로","meaning":"事实","explanation":"사실：事实；대로：表示“按照、就……而言、各自”。","readings":[{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71275","senseId":"1","lemma":"사실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사실대로","audio":"/audio/38c1dddb6a6e9ba5c7d5.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀드리자.","meaning":"话；致，道","explanation":"말씀：话；드리다：致，道；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"2","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀드리자","audio":"/audio/dfa5917a15480fe9eed2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"c087c9